@dsh-external/dsh-model-router README · Model purchase strategy / 模型购买策略：The principle is “cheap default, targeted upgrade, explicit media call.” Prices and model availability change, so always check the provider’s current official page before purchasing.

原则是“低成本模型做默认、复杂任务定向升级、媒体模型明确调用”。价格和模型可用性会变化，购买前请以各提供方当期官网为准。

See [Model strategy and routing boundaries / 模型策略与路由边界](./docs/model-strategy.md) for details.

@dsh-external/dsh-model-router README · Requirements / 运行要求：- DeepSeek Harness 0.1.0-rc.6
- Node.js `^22.19.0` or / 或 `>=24.0.0`
- pnpm 11 for development or rebuilding / 仅开发或重新构建时需要 pnpm 11

@dsh-external/dsh-model-router README · Install from GitHub / 从 GitHub 安装：```bash
git clone https://github.com/superboy911/dsh-model-router.git
cd dsh-model-router

@dsh-external/dsh-model-router README · Optional: reproduce the committed build. / 可选：复现仓库中的构建产物。：corepack enable
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm build
